of profits, loss of goodwill, loss of opportunity, loss of time, exemplary or special damage, or any indirect loss as a result of usage of the website."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"c56771a25b4a","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"c56771a25b4a0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"While care is taken to ensure that the information presented is accurate, the same cannot be guaranteed. Hence, it is recommended that you take adequate steps to establish the veracity of information before taking a decision."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"218abdfdc996","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"218abdfdc9960","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Past performance is not a guarantee for future results. Investments in the financial and securities market are subject to market risks. Satisfy yourself fully before investing."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"a41ce89792de","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"a41ce89792de0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Dhanopinion does not control the network or the service delivering the website to you over the internet. Hence, Dhanopinion does not bear any liability for any infringement or alteration during the transmission."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"e201dd21552e","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"e201dd21552e0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"This presents opinions and a point of view that can be used to compare with alternative strategies. Dhanopinion is not a registered financial advisor and therefore you should not treat anything provided as financial advice that is regulated by any government regulatory authority. Consider this to be the type of financial guidance that would be provided by a self-help book on personal finances that is not covered by any regulatory authority."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}],"slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"disclaimer"},"title":"Terms and Conditions and Disclaimer"}');
INSERT INTO `sanity_page` (`id`, `data`) VALUES ('page-about-us', '{"_createdAt":"2026-07-15T06:12:14Z","_id":"page-about-us","_rev":"ZD9hpBEYl1x1VYz1fFmMsP","_system":{"base":{"id":"page-about-us","rev":"ZD9hpBEYl1x1VYz1fFmEr7"}},"_type":"page","_updatedAt":"2026-07-27T05:20:07Z","body":[{"_key":"ff2e208f34db","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"ff2e208f34db0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"About Us"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"ff4f69591096","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"ff4f695910960","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Personal Financial Advice is a huge area of activity. It can have a significant impact on household wealth and wellbeing. It is our experience and observation that things are often not working very well."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"59aa3f9d2cf6","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"59aa3f9d2cf60","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"People find it difficult to understand and make investment decisions. They end up with too little or too much risk relative to what they would have chosen if they had the expertise to make the best decisions for themselves. They often incur costs and fees in the process, but do not know what they are paying and what results they are getting for the payments."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"c76fbd66a4d1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"c76fbd66a4d10","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Unfortunately, there is often a conflict of interest between the product providers and advisors and the clients. The products that generate the highest profits for the providers are not the best investments for their clients, while the best investment solutions generate very low profits for the providers."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"f552536e250f","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"f552536e250f0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"DhanOpinion is an experiment to see if we can contribute to making the investment process and outcomes better for people. The objective is to provide simple effective guidance at low cost. We believe we can leverage our education, training and experience to provide something of value to a large number of people in an efficient way."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"549a1699ee8b","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"549a1699ee8b0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"If you find DhanOpinion useful, please let us know. If there is something you would like us to analyze that would be useful to you and many others, let us know and we will consider doing the analysis. If you have any specific suggestions or expertise that you would like to contribute to the effort please let us know. It will help us greatly if you can fill in the brief questionnaire below."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"formBlockContact","_type":"formBlock","destinationEmail":"response@dhanopinion.com","fields":[{"_key":"awwk3loh","inputType":"text","label":"Name","name":"contactName","required":true},{"_key":"mqpjw8ud","inputType":"email","label":"Email","name":"contactEmail","required":true},{"_key":"p39vey6m","inputType":"tel","label":"Phone Number","name":"contactPhone","required":true},{"_key":"82ln7omu","inputType":"textarea","label":"Message","name":"message","required":true}],"formType":"custom","submitButtonText":"Send Message","subtitle":"Have a question? Send us a message or email us at response@dhanopinion.com.","title":"Contact Us"},{"_key":"formBlockFeedback","_type":"formBlock","fields":[{"_key":"rvrb2z9r","inputType":"text","label":"Name","name":"name","required":true},{"_key":"hk0ic3ly","inputType":"tel","label":"Mobile","name":"mobile","required":true},{"_key":"fotulctr","inputType":"email","label":"Email","name":"email","required":true},{"_key":"4fhzjzh3","inputType":"radio","label":"Is DhanOpinion useful?","name":"isUseful","options":["Yes","No"],"required":true},{"_key":"6d6d9mfn","inputType":"radio","label":"Do you know how much you are paying for your investments?","name":"knowFees","options":["Yes","No"],"required":true},{"_key":"dlcmynom","inputType":"radio","label":"Do you know what percentage of your investments are in equity?","name":"knowStocksPct","options":["Yes","No"],"required":true},{"_key":"coq8mrci","inputType":"radio","label":"Would you be willing to pay anything to cover costs?","name":"willingToPay","options":["Yes","No"],"required":true},{"_key":"ba7f2d597608","inputType":"radio","label":"Did Dhanopinion help you get to a better equity allocation?","name":"Betterallocation","options":["Yes","No"],"required":true},{"_key":"30c9e44f9131","inputType":"radio","label":"Did you open an NPS account or use it more?","name":"NPSaccount","options":["Yes","No"],"required":true},{"_key":"hqvapgh2","inputType":"textarea","label":"What else would be valuable to you?","name":"valuableThings","required":true},{"_key":"a2egerwn","inputType":"textarea","label":"Anything else you would like to share?","name":"anythingElse","required":true}],"formType":"custom","submitButtonText":"Submit Feedback","subtitle":"If you have specific suggestions or expertise you would like to contribute, please let us know.","title":"Leave Feedback"}],"slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"about-us"},"title":"About Us"}');
